# Image Assets Required

Place the following images in this folder:

## Required Channel Icons
- icon_focus_hd.png (540x405) - Channel icon when focused
- icon_focus_sd.png (246x140) - SD channel icon
- icon_side_hd.png (108x81) - Side panel icon
- icon_side_sd.png (55x41) - SD side panel icon

## Required Splash Screens
- splash_hd.jpg (1920x1080) - HD splash screen
- splash_sd.jpg (720x480) - SD splash screen

## App Assets
- logo.png (200x60) - Header logo
- logo-large.png (400x400) - Logo slide display
- spinner.png (100x100) - Loading spinner animation
- glow.png (800x800) - Radial glow effect for logo slide

## Service Logos
- reddit-logo.png (40x40) - Reddit icon
- github-logo.png (40x40) - GitHub icon
- youtube-play.png (120x84) - YouTube play button overlay

## Notes
- Use PNG format for transparency
- Optimize images for file size (Roku has memory limits)
- Test on actual device to verify appearance
